R014_negative_size.cmm:3:13: runtime error: array size must not be negative (got -1)
  |
3 |     let a = array<int>(-1, 0);
  |             ^
what went wrong:
  An array was created with a negative size of -1.
how to fix:
  Provide a non-negative size (0 or greater) when creating an array.
      array<int>(5, 0)
